  "truncatedDescription": "The Daily Dweebs' is a pilot episode of a animated series revolving around the pet Dixey and his shenanigans in 1950's American suburbia.\r\n\r\nThis pilot was created by the Blender Animation Studio in Amsterdam, The Netherlands, and made possible wi...",
  "description": "The Daily Dweebs' is a pilot episode of a animated series revolving around the pet Dixey and his shenanigans in 1950's American suburbia.\r\n\r\nThis pilot was created by the Blender Animation Studio in Amsterdam, The Netherlands, and made possible with support from thousands of people from all around the world via subscription to the Blender Cloud.\r\n\r\nRelease date: Oct 19, 2017\r\nDuration: 1m\r\nCountry: Netherlands\r\nDirector: Hjalti Hjalmarsson\r\nMusic: Bjarni Biering\r\nSound design: Sander Houtman\r\nLayout and animation direction: Hjalti Hjalmarsson\r\nArt Director: Andy Goralczyk\r\nPipeline and Software: Sergey Sharybin and Sybren Stüvel\r\nVoice actors: Devin Compton and Hjalti Hjalmarsson\r\nProduced by: Francesco Siddi\r\nExecutive producer: Ton Roosendaal",
